  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_gaud_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>one of the larger and more ornamental beads placed between the decades of ‘aves’ in a rosary (OED s.v. gaud n.1), here made of latten | one of the larger and more ornamental beads placed between the decades of ‘aves’ in a rosary (OED s.v. gaud n.1), here made of glass | one of the larger and more ornamental beads placed between the decades of ‘aves’ in a rosary (OED s.v. gaud n.1)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
